OL,5,G2200 Classic FM Live: Greatest Hits
OL,6,G     Hits of Opera
OL,7,     FThe Royal Albert Hall comes to
OL,8,     Flife with hits from the world of
OL,9,     Fopera. Hosted by Alexander
OL,10,     FArmstrong and Myleene Klass and
OL,11,     Ffilmed in April 2023.
OL,12,G0010 Mozart's Women: A Musical Journey
OL,13,     FA night of unforgettable music and
OL,14,     Fperformance. Filmed live at the
OL,15,     FLondon Coliseum, Mozart's Women
OL,16,     Ffeatures performances from some of
OL,17,     Fopera's brightest stars.
